#: filter/mdnadvicedialog.cpp:55
msgid ""
"This message contains a request to return a notification about your "
"reception of the message.\n"
"You can either ignore the request or let the mail program send a \"denied\" "
"or normal response."
msgstr ""
"Ova poruka sadrži zahtijev da vrati notifikaciju o vašom prijemu poruke.\n"
"Vi može te ignorisati zahtijev ili pustiti da poštanski program posalje "
"\"odbijen\" ili normalan odgovor."

#: filter/mdnadvicedialog.cpp:60
msgid ""
"This message contains a request to send a notification about your reception "
"of the message.\n"
"It contains a processing instruction that is marked as \"required\", but "
"which is unknown to the mail program.\n"
"You can either ignore the request or let the mail program send a \"failed\" "
"response."
msgstr ""
"Ova poruka sadrži zahtijev da vrati notifikaciju o vašom prijemu poruke.\n"
"Sadrži instrukcije koje su selektovane kao \"potrebne\", ali je nepoznato "
"poštanskom programu.\n"
"Vi može te ignorisati zahtijev ili pustiti da poštanski program posalje "
"\"odbijen\" ili normalan odgovor."

#: filter/mdnadvicedialog.cpp:67
msgid ""
"This message contains a request to send a notification about your reception "
"of the message,\n"
"but it is requested to send the notification to more than one address.\n"
"You can either ignore the request or let the mail program send a \"denied\" "
"or normal response."
msgstr ""
"Ova poruka sadrži zahtijev da vrati notifikaciju o vašom prijemu poruke,\n"
"ali zahtijeva da posaljete notifikaciju o više od jedne adrese.\n"
"Vi može te ignorisati zahtijev ili pustiti da poštanski program posalje "
"\"odbijen\" ili normalan odgovor."

#: filter/mdnadvicedialog.cpp:74
msgid ""
"This message contains a request to send a notification about your reception "
"of the message,\n"
"but there is no return-path set.\n"
"You can either ignore the request or let the mail program send a \"denied\" "
"or normal response."
msgstr ""
"Ova poruka sadrži zahtijev da vrati notifikaciju o vašom prijemu poruke,\n"
"ali nije stavljen uzvratni put.\n"
"Vi može te ignorisati zahtijev ili pustiti da poštanski program posalje "
"\"odbijen\" ili normalan odgovor."

#: filter/mdnadvicedialog.cpp:80
msgid ""
"This message contains a request to send a notification about your reception "
"of the message,\n"
"but the return-path address differs from the address the notification was "
"requested to be sent to.\n"
"You can either ignore the request or let the mail program send a \"denied\" "
"or normal response."
msgstr ""
"Ova poruka sadrži zahtijev da vrati notifikaciju o vašom prijemu poruke,\n"
"ali uzvrani put adrese se razlikuje od adrese koja je bila poslana od strane "
"notifikacije.\n"
"Vi može te ignorisati zahtijev ili pustiti da poštanski program posalje "
"\"odbijen\" ili normalan odgovor."

